# Scenario content lives here (M1-1).
#
# One directory per scenario, one file per immutable version. Versions are never
# edited in place — retire and supersede (CLAUDE.md invariant 4). Every file
# requires a provenance block: author, ORIGINAL | LICENSED, review status,
# similarity-check result.
#
# Reviewed by pull request. There is no authoring UI in the MVP (docs/MVP.md).
